exports[`golden 输出 > gallery@1 的输出逐字节稳定 1`] = `"<article data-testid="renderer-gallery" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10"><h1 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-semibold" data-testid="pub-title">保存与活着</h1><p class="mx-auto mb-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">前言</p><section data-testid="pub-moment" class="mb-12"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><figure data-testid="pub-asset"><img src="/p/%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%8E%E6%B4%BB%E7%9D%80-gallery/a/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa.webp" alt="但这张让我不确定" width="1600" height="1200" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded object-cover" loading="lazy"/><figcaption class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-500">但这张让我不确定 · 但这张让我不确定</figcaption></figure></div><div class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl"><h2 class="mb-1 text-base font-medium">秩父支路</h2><p class="mb-2 text-xs text-neutral-500">2026-03-14 · 秩父神社</p><p class="mb-1 text-sm text-neutral-600">住家门口没有招牌。</p><blockquote data-testid="pub-interpretation" class="mt-2 border-l-2 border-neutral-300 pl-3 text-sm italic text-neutral-700">这里的人还打算住下去。</blockquote></div></section><section data-testid="pub-tombstone" class="mb-6 rounded border border-dashed border-neutral-300 p-4 text-sm text-neutral-500"><p class="mb-2">「商业主街」的原始记录已被作者删除，以下是发布时保留的内容：</p><p class="mb-1">每一块招牌都在互相盖过对方。</p></section><p class="mx-auto mb-6 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">结论</p></article>"`;

